# Cloudflare Pages redirects — SectorScope
#
# Rewrite (200), not redirect (301/302). A redirect would bounce the URL
# back to / and the deep link would not survive a refresh or a shared
# link; a 200 rewrite serves index.html while the address bar keeps
# /videos, which is what the router in index.html reads on cold load.
#
# Only /videos is listed. Every other page lives at / and is switched
# client-side by showPage(), so no catch-all is needed — and adding one
# would swallow real 404s for mistyped paths.

/videos     /index.html   200
/videos/    /index.html   200
